{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "name": "ECS Local Demo — MinIO File Upload with IDM",
    "description": "Manual testing collection for the ECS Local Demo app with Identity and Access Management (IDM).\n\nPrerequisites:\n1. Run `docker compose up -d` to start MinIO + app\n2. Wait until both services are healthy\n3. Set Bearer token variables (see Variables tab)\n4. Use the requests below\n\nIDM Features:\n- Bearer token authentication from Authorization header\n- User-scoped file paths: users/{userId}/yyyy-MM-dd/filename\n- userId included in all responses for audit trail",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Base URL of the running app. Change to your server URL if deployed remotely."
    },
    {
      "key": "user1_token",
      "value": "dXNlcjEyMzp1c2VyQGV4YW1wbGUuY29t",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Bearer token for user1 (Base64: user123:user@example.com)"
    },
    {
      "key": "user2_token",
      "value": "anNvbjp0ZXN0QGV4YW1wbGUuY29t",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Bearer token for user2 (Base64: json:test@example.com)"
    },
    {
      "key": "user3_token",
      "value": "ZGV2ZWxvcGVyOmRldkBleGFtcGxlLmNvbQ==",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Bearer token for user3 (Base64: developer:dev@example.com)"
    },
    {
      "key": "custom_token",
      "value": "dXNlcm5hbWU6ZW1haWxAZXhhbXBsZS5jb20=",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Custom Bearer token - modify this for testing. Format: Base64(userId:email)"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1️⃣ Health Check",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/actuator/health",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["actuator", "health"]
        },
        "description": "Verify the application is running and healthy.\nNo authentication required (public endpoint).\n\nExpected: 200 OK with {\"status\": \"UP\"}"
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "Healthy",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/actuator/health" }
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "body": "{\"status\":\"UP\"}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2️⃣ Upload File (User 1 - With Bearer Token)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{user1_token}}",
            "type": "text",
            "description": "Bearer token extracted from Authorization header"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "formdata",
          "formdata": [
            {
              "key": "file",
              "type": "file",
              "src": "",
              "description": "Select any file from your computer to upload"
            }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/files/upload",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "files", "upload"]
        },
        "description": "✅ SUCCESS CASE: Upload a file with Bearer token authentication.\n\nSteps:\n1. Go to 'Headers' tab\n2. Verify Authorization header: Bearer {{user1_token}}\n3. Go to 'Body' tab → 'form-data'\n4. Set the 'file' field type to 'File'\n5. Click 'Select Files' and pick any file\n6. Click 'Send'\n\nExpected response: 201 Created\n```json\n{\n  \"key\": \"users/user123/2024-07-22/uuid-filename.pdf\",\n  \"bucket\": \"demo-bucket\",\n  \"contentType\": \"application/pdf\",\n  \"sizeBytes\": 12345,\n  \"uploadedAt\": \"2024-07-22T07:30:00Z\",\n  \"userId\": \"user123\"\n}\n```\n\nFile Path: users/user123/ (user-scoped)\nVerify in MinIO: http://localhost:9001"
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "Success - 201 Created",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer dXNlcjEyMzp1c2VyQGV4YW1wbGUuY29t"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [{ "key": "file", "type": "file", "src": "" }]
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/files/upload" }
          },
          "status": "Created",
          "code": 201,
          "body": "{\n  \"key\": \"users/user123/2024-07-22/a3f1b2c4-example.pdf\",\n  \"bucket\": \"demo-bucket\",\n  \"contentType\": \"application/pdf\",\n  \"sizeBytes\": 8192,\n  \"uploadedAt\": \"2024-07-22T07:30:00.000Z\",\n  \"userId\": \"user123\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3️⃣ Upload File (User 2 - Different User)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{user2_token}}",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "formdata",
          "formdata": [
            {
              "key": "file",
              "type": "file",
              "src": "",
              "description": "Select a file to test user isolation"
            }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/files/upload",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "files", "upload"]
        },
        "description": "✅ USER ISOLATION TEST: Upload file as a different user.\n\nVerify:\n1. Response includes userId: \"json\" (not \"user123\")\n2. File is stored in users/json/ folder (not users/user123/)\n3. Different users have isolated storage\n\nToken: {{user2_token}} = Base64(json:test@example.com)"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4️⃣ Upload File (User 3 - Third User)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{user3_token}}",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "formdata",
          "formdata": [
            {
              "key": "file",
              "type": "file",
              "src": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/files/upload",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "files", "upload"]
        },
        "description": "More user testing. Token: {{user3_token}} = Base64(developer:dev@example.com)"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "❌ Error: Missing Authorization Header",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "body": {
          "mode": "formdata",
          "formdata": [
            {
              "key": "file",
              "type": "file",
              "src": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/files/upload",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "files", "upload"]
        },
        "description": "❌ ERROR CASE: Missing Authorization header.\n\nExpected: 400 Bad Request\nError: \"Authorization header is missing\"\n\nFix: Add Authorization header with valid Bearer token"
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "Error - 400 Missing Header",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/files/upload" }
          },
          "status": "Bad Request",
          "code": 400,
          "body": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "❌ Error: Invalid Bearer Token (Not Base64)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer invalid_token_not_base64",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "formdata",
          "formdata": [
            {
              "key": "file",
              "type": "file",
              "src": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/files/upload",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "files", "upload"]
        },
        "description": "❌ ERROR CASE: Invalid Bearer token (not valid Base64).\n\nExpected: 400 Bad Request\nError: \"Invalid token encoding\"\n\nFix: Ensure token is valid Base64-encoded userId:email"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "❌ Error: Malformed Token (Missing Colon)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer anRzdGluZ3Bhc3N3b3Jk",
            "type": "text",
            "description": "Base64(justauserwithoutcolon)"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "formdata",
          "formdata": [
            {
              "key": "file",
              "type": "file",
              "src": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/files/upload",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "files", "upload"]
        },
        "description": "❌ ERROR CASE: Token without colon separator.\n\nExpected: 400 Bad Request\nError: \"Invalid token format\"\n\nFix: Use format Base64(userId:email)"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "❌ Error: Empty Bearer Token",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
